sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as Gateway (Envoy)<br/>Istio / GKE
    participant BBR as Body-Based Router<br/>9004/TCP gRPC TLS
    participant EPP as Endpoint Picker<br/>9002/TCP gRPC TLS
    participant ModelServer as Model Server Pod<br/>(vLLM / SGLang / Triton)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MetricsEndpoint as Model Server /metrics<br/>HTTP

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Client,ModelServer: Flow 1: Direct Inference Request Routing (EPP Only)
        Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP/HTTPS (80/443)
        Gateway->>EPP: gRPC ext-proc ProcessingRequest<br/>9002/TCP TLS (self-signed)
        Note over EPP: Filter-Score-Pick pipeline:<br/>1. Filter by model availability<br/>2. Score by KV cache + queue depth<br/>3. Pick optimal endpoint<br/>4. Flow control (priority + fairness)
        EPP-->>Gateway: ProcessingResponse<br/>Set target endpoint headers
        Gateway->>ModelServer: Forward to selected pod<br/>HTTP/HTTP2
        ModelServer-->>Gateway: Inference Response
        Gateway-->>Client: JSON Response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over Client,ModelServer: Flow 2: Body-Based Routing (BBR + EPP)
        Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>{"model": "llama-lora-adapter"}<br/>HTTP 80/TCP
        Gateway->>BBR: gRPC ext-proc (body phase)<br/>9004/TCP TLS
        Note over BBR: Plugin: BodyFieldToHeader<br/>Extract "model" from JSON body<br/>Plugin: BaseModelExtractor<br/>Resolve LoRA → base model
        BBR-->>Gateway: Set X-Gateway-Model-Name header<br/>9004/TCP gRPC TLS
        Gateway->>EPP: gRPC ext-proc (header phase)<br/>9002/TCP TLS<br/>Routes by X-Gateway-Model-Name
        Note over EPP: Schedule to endpoint<br/>with matching LoRA adapter
        EPP-->>Gateway: Set target endpoint
        Gateway->>ModelServer: Forward to LoRA-capable pod<br/>HTTP
        ModelServer-->>Gateway: Inference Response
        Gateway-->>Client: JSON Response
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over EPP,MetricsEndpoint: Flow 3: Metrics-Driven Scheduling (Background)
        loop Every 50ms (configurable)
            EPP->>MetricsEndpoint: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP (TLS skip verify default)
            MetricsEndpoint-->>EPP: Prometheus metrics:<br/>kv_cache_usage_perc<br/>num_requests_waiting<br/>num_requests_running<br/>lora_requests_info
            Note over EPP: Update in-memory datastore<br/>per-endpoint metrics
        end
    end

    rect rgb(248, 240, 255)
        Note over EPP,K8sAPI: Flow 4: CRD Reconciliation (Background)
        K8sAPI-->>EPP: Watch events:<br/>InferencePool, InferenceObjective,<br/>InferenceModelRewrite, Pods
        Note over EPP: Update datastore:<br/>pool config, scheduling objectives,<br/>model rewrite rules, endpoint list
    end
